{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>深水埗大埔道338號一個油站對開有野生動物受傷。（Google地圖截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>深水埗有野生動物受傷。 今日（18日）凌晨1時許，據了解，有兩名途人先後經過深水埗大埔道338號一個油站對開時，發現一隻野猴口吐白泡，於是報案求助和通知愛協，愛協人員接報後到場，惟野猴已經爬樹離開。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T03:18:46.734222+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T02:22:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T09:17:55.711220+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T03:17:35.739026+00:00","content_hash":"56136a2dda71ee4426a8a2199cc7395ca58ed7399dd970670af06e901c02949e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}